    "linkedin:7c3b7af1d060281d6466ee61": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Frontend Developer",
        "company": "AgileGrid Solutions",
        "location": "",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4468645313",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**About The Company**\n Meet Life Sciences is an innovative startup dedicated to transforming the pharmaceutical and life sciences industry by accelerating the commercialization of therapeutics. Backed by top\\-tier investors, the company specializes in developing AI\\-driven enterprise tools that enable faster, more efficient, and compliant marketing strategies for top life sciences manufacturers and major brands. Meet Life Sciences prides itself on fostering a dynamic, high\\-velocity environment where cutting\\-edge technology meets impactful healthcare solutions. The company's mission is to revolutionize how therapeutics are brought to market by leveraging advanced AI and innovative design to streamline workflows and enhance decision\\-making processes.\n   \n\n  \n\n**About The Role**\n Meet Life Sciences is seeking a talented Front\\-End and UX Engineer with 1 to 5 years of professional experience to join our innovative team. In this ground\\-floor opportunity, you will be instrumental in designing and building world\\-class interfaces for our AI\\-first enterprise platforms. As a key member of our product development team, you will work closely with co\\-founders and cross\\-functional teams to craft beautiful, high\\-performance, and responsive user interfaces that translate complex AI insights into intuitive tools. Your work will directly impact the future of pharma tech by pushing the boundaries of product design and creating next\\-generation interfaces that solve real\\-world industry challenges. This role offers a unique chance to be at the forefront of a rapidly scaling startup, owning the front\\-end architecture and contributing to the company's growth and success.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Qualifications**\n* 1 to 5 years of professional experience building enterprise\\-grade front\\-end systems using React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\n* Strong product intuition with a keen eye for UX polish and real\\-time, interactive workflows handling complex data seamlessly.\n* Proven ability to work independently with a bias toward action and problem\\-solving in fast\\-paced, ambiguous startup environments.\n* Excellent communication skills and a strong work ethic, with a passion for building impactful products from scratch.\n* Experience collaborating with backend and AI teams to deliver integrated, high\\-quality web applications.\n\n\n**Responsibilities**\n* Design and develop production\\-grade web applications utilizing Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\n* Collaborate closely with backend and AI teams to ensure seamless integration and optimal performance of user interfaces.\n* Create intuitive, visually appealing, and highly responsive UI components that enhance user experience and facilitate complex workflows.\n* Translate user requirements and AI insights into innovative design solutions that meet industry standards and compliance regulations.\n* Participate in code reviews, testing, and continuous improvement processes to maintain high\\-quality standards.\n* Stay updated with the latest front\\-end technologies and industry trends to continually enhance product design and functionality.\n\n\n**Benefits**\n Meet Life Sciences offers a competitive package that includes ground\\-floor equity opportunities, providing you with ownership in the company's growth. You will have the chance to accelerate your career in a fast\\-paced startup environment, gaining valuable experience at the intersection of AI, design, and pharma technology. The company promotes a collaborative culture with flexible work arrangements, professional development opportunities, and a supportive team dedicated to innovation and impact. Joining Meet Life Sciences means becoming part of a pioneering organization committed to transforming healthcare through technology and design excellence.\n   \n\n  \n\n Equal Opportunity\n   \n\n  \n\n Meet Life Sciences is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We do not discriminate based on race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, age, disability, or any other legally protected status. We believe that diverse teams foster innovation and creativity, and we are dedicated to providing equal employment opportunities to all qualified candidates.",
